WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.154
Every business today runs on trust.

00:00:02.417 --> 00:00:03.605
An employee signs in.

00:00:03.605 --> 00:00:05.303
A cloud service calls another.

00:00:05.303 --> 00:00:06.605
A customer sends money.

00:00:06.605 --> 00:00:08.088
A team asks AI for help.

00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:11.092
Behind every one of these moments is an identity.

00:00:12.333 --> 00:00:13.163
Meet adapID AI.

00:00:13.163 --> 00:00:14.768
It protects those identities,

00:00:14.768 --> 00:00:15.889
human and machine.

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:18.842
It keeps reading every session after the login.

00:00:18.842 --> 00:00:19.582
When the device,

00:00:19.582 --> 00:00:21.295
the network or the behaviour changes,

00:00:21.295 --> 00:00:22.392
trust adapts with it.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.788
It finds the machine identities across your AWS accounts,

00:00:30.788 --> 00:00:33.430
shows what each one can reach and what it really uses,

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:35.609
and proposes the least privilege it needs.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.632
And in digital banking,

00:00:40.632 --> 00:00:41.960
it recognises the customer,

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:43.781
not just the password: how they type,

00:00:43.781 --> 00:00:44.496
tap and pay.

00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:53.591
Even an impostor with valid credentials stands out.

00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:57.357
As teams bring AI into their daily work,

00:00:57.357 --> 00:00:59.708
sensitive data can travel with every prompt.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.891
Zenstra AI checks what is about to leave,

00:01:03.891 --> 00:01:06.552
and stops credentials and secrets before they are sent.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.293
Your teams get the power of AI,

00:01:12.293 --> 00:01:13.294
without the exposure.

00:01:19.167 --> 00:01:20.535
Deep Algorithms Solutions.

00:01:20.535 --> 00:01:23.185
Securing identity and AI in the connected world.

